<title>DENMARK: Tryg-Baltica, Colonia units merge.</title>
<headline>Tryg-Baltica, Colonia units merge.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>British subsidiaries of Danish insurer Tryg-Baltica A/S and Germany's Colonia Versicherung AG are to merge under the name Colonia Baltica Insurance Company (UK) Ltd, a Tryg-Baltica statement said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Subject to formal agreement, expected within two weeks, the new company will be owned half each by the Danish and German parents, the statement said.</p>
<p>-- Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
